Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:34:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Evolver: rename the hub to Expressive Studio

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: its customization hub was still called
"The Evolver" with Evolution X's tagline. Drop the old translations so
the new name and subtitle show until they are translated again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
